Here's a possible translation of the text into UVL-Code:
```
Team "Security Team" {
    Role "Security Architect"
    Role "Security Engineer"
    Constraint "Security Architect"!= "Security Engineer"

    Role "Manager"
    Role "Scrum Master"
}
```

This code defines a team called "Security Team" with two roles: "Security Architect" and "Security Engineer". It also specifies that these two roles cannot be filled by the same person (using the `!=` operator). Finally, it adds two additional roles to the team: "Manager" and "Scrum Master".